    ("r" (cond ((& (= PT ?c) (! (= P ?r)) (! (= P ?y)) (! (= P ?w)) (! (= P ?x)) (! (= P ?Z))) "্র") (1 "র")) (set P ?r) (set PT ?c))
    ("oo" (cond ((& (! (= PT ?c)) (! (= @+1 ?`))) "উ") ((& (= PT '') (! (= @+1 ?`))) "উ") (1 "ু")) (set P ?o) (set PT ?v))
